  "description": "Bring the spirit of Japan into your designs with Mitohan – a unique display font inspired by traditional Japanese aesthetics, fused with a modern twist. Perfect for eye-catching projects such as posters, branding, apparel, logos, food packaging, and anything with an Asian flair.\nWith bold letterforms, geometric Japanese-style elements, and a retro-futuristic touch, Mitohan comes in 4 styles: Regular, Extrude, Slant, and Stroke – offering flexibility and striking visual depth to every word.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring the spirit of Japan into your designs with Mitohan – a unique display font inspired by traditional Japanese aesthetics, fused with a modern twist. Perfect for eye-catching projects such as posters, branding, apparel, logos, food packaging, and anything with an Asian flair.</p>\n<p>With bold letterforms, geometric Japanese-style elements, and a retro-futuristic touch, Mitohan comes in 4 styles: Regular, Extrude, Slant, and Stroke – offering flexibility and striking visual depth to every word.</p>",
